00:01:56.767 --> 00:01:57.367
A.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:57.967
Little,

00:01:57.967 --> 00:01:58.600
B.

00:01:58.600 --> 00:01:59.200
Short,

00:01:59.200 --> 00:01:59.800
C.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:00.433
Tiny,

00:02:00.433 --> 00:02:01.633
