00:08:22.933 --> 00:08:25.667
then six plus two makes...

00:08:25.667 --> 00:08:26.200
what?

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:26.733
A.

00:08:26.733 --> 00:08:27.300
Eight,

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:27.833
B.

00:08:27.833 --> 00:08:28.367
Fourteen,

00:08:28.367 --> 00:08:28.933
C.

00:08:28.933 --> 00:08:29.467
Twelve,

00:08:29.467 --> 00:08:30.567
or D.

00:08:30.567 --> 00:08:31.100
Sixteen?

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:32.200
Five seconds!

00:08:37.967 --> 00:08:39.167
TIME'S UP!

00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:41.233
The answer is...

00:08:41.233 --> 00:08:41.700
C,

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:42.167
twelve!

00:08:42.167 --> 00:08:44.967
The plus sign secretly means multiply:

00:08:44.967 --> 00:08:47.333
